se-cleared\n  dependencies.\n- HLR-2 (P1): the Feast SDK cannot ship in a supported workbench image unless\n  its dependency tree is license-cleared.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35253,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-91b23b54818dce6f","agent_id":"a074d0cc1b5a9e09c","session_id":"70be5069-4ad1-4d5f-b439-3a3690791b3e","uuid":"263d2d40-5cee-40b1-9b09-9868ef60941d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:33:53.240Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9006"}
