he product registry.\n51\t- Verify the pipelines execute against the initial repository state.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A Konflux application exists for the midstream Feast repository with build\n56\t  pipelines configured per the known onboarding recipe.\n57\t- Container images build and are published to the product registry with\n58\t  reproducible tags/digests.\n59\t- Given the pipeline is onboarded, when the deployment implementation lands\n60\t  its code, then productized images build green in Konflux — measured by a\n61\t  green pipeline run on the implementation's merged code.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- HLR-1 (P0): administrators can only enable a supported Feature Store with\n66\t  productized images; this epic provides the build pipeline that produces\n67\t  them.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b10a0d1c266c9606","agent_id":"addcab36216e63e99","session_id":"70be5069-4ad1-4d5f-b439-3a3690791b3e","uuid":"96b2db72-a62e-434b-a7d0-e5edd0eec1fc","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:40:54.307Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8144cd78f15cb338","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9006 decomposition"}
